The benchmarks in this directory were submitted by Ruijie Fang.
They were taken from the following paper:
 Ruijie Fang, Zachary Kincaid, Thomas Reps. "Software Model Checking via Summary-Guided Search." OOPSLA 2025
They correspond to the "Unparametrizable" category of "Suite #3 --- Lock and Key Benchmarks" described in the evaluations section of the paper.

The program in this folder is adapted from Figure 2 of the following paper:
 - Patrice Godefroid and Daniel Luchaup. 2011. Automatic partial loop summarization in dynamic test generation. In
Proceedings of the 2011 International Symposium on Software Testing and Analysis (Toronto, Ontario, Canada) (ISSTA
’11). Association for Computing Machinery, New York, NY, USA, 23–33.
